<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>RESPONSE NOTES</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>响应模型注意点：检索准，还要答得对</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='object-group' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 8 }}>上下文融合</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          把检索片段与问题组织成清晰 prompt，明确「依据片段回答」，避免模型忽略上下文。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='shield' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 8 }}>幻觉抑制</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          约束模型「不知道就承认」，检索无结果时禁止编造，必要时附来源。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='link' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 8 }}>逻辑连贯性</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          多片段信息要整合成通顺表达，避免东拼西凑、前后矛盾。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 5 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>09 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
